# GitHub Linguist: keep the language bar honest. The repo's own code is C (the
# Wine driver / TAP bridge) and shell. The bundled noVNC (JavaScript) and
# websockify (Python) are third-party UI dependencies and must not dominate the
# "Languages" statistic. Extension matching is the most reliable form in
# .gitattributes (directory globs can miss nested files).
*.js   linguist-vendored
*.mjs  linguist-vendored
*.css  linguist-vendored
*.html linguist-vendored

websockify/** linguist-vendored
prebuilt/**   linguist-vendored
